{
  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"DateAndNumberFormat\">Date & Number Format</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action And By Code Date DateAndNumberFormat Is NumberFormat On Settings To ToDate Transaction\">The <code>Date & Number Format</code> form, found under the <code>Settings</code> tab, enables you to input details that will be displayed on transaction forms and utilized by the software.</p><div class=\"flex pointer-events-none space-x-6 rtl:space-x-reverse items-center\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 inline-block ltr:pr-8 rtl:pl-8\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-200 ltr:pl-8 rtl:pr-8\"><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"border-y ltr:border-l rtl:border-r border-neutral-300 bg-white p-4 flex gap-2 items-center\"><i class=\"fas fa-cog text-neutral-400\"></i><span class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-[#428bca]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Settings\">Settings</span></span></div><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div></div></div><span class=\"rtl:hidden\"><i class=\"fas fa-circle-chevron-right text-lg text-neutral-300\"></i></span><span class=\"ltr:hidden\"><i class=\"fas fa-circle-chevron-left text-lg text-neutral-300\"></i></span><div class=\"border rounded inline-block pointer-events-none\"><div class=\"basis-72 flex items-center gap-2 p-4\"><i class=\"text-xl text-neutral-400 fas fa-fw fa-calendar-alt\"></i><span class=\"text-sm text-[#428bca]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"DateAndNumberFormat\">Date & Number Format</span></span></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"\">Please fill in the following fields:</p><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"DateFormat\">Date format</span></summary><div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Business Date DateFormat Is\">Choose a date format. This will determine how dates are entered and displayed throughout the business.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"TimeFormat\">Time format</span></summary><div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Business Is TimeFormat\">Choose the time format. This determines how time is displayed throughout the business.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"FirstDayOfWeek\">First day of week</span></summary><div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Is On To ToDate\">Choose the first day of the week that is standard for your region. This setting adjusts the calendar picker to display the calendar in a way that is familiar to you.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"NumberFormat\">Number format</span></summary><div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Business Currencies Is NumberFormat To ToDate\">Choose the number format. This format will be applied to how all numbers and currencies are displayed throughout the business.</p></div></details><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Code Date Next On To ToDate Update\">Next, click the <code>Update</code> button to save your changes.</p><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 inline-block pointer-events-none\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-200 text-neutral-900 p-8 text-sm\"><span class=\"border font-semibold rounded-md py-3 px-4 bg-[#5cb85c] border-[#4cae4c] text-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Update\">Update</span></span></div></div>",
  "key": "date-and-number-format-form"
}
